OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F402A1787087916
OL,3,CSeveral businesses destroyed by large
OL,4,Cgrass fire in Weston-super-Mare
OL,6,FSeveral businesses have been badly
OL,7,Fdamaged in a large grass fire in
OL,8,FWeston-super-Mare.
OL,10,FThe manager of Locking Farm Industrial
OL,11,FEstate said that he believed half of
OL,12,Fthe businesses on the site had been
OL,13,Fseriously affected.
OL,15,FOne of the businesses badly affected
OL,16,Fis White Noise Studios, a rehearsal
OL,17,Fand recording venue for musicians.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G1/4
