OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F402A1787087916
OL,3,CSeveral businesses destroyed by large
OL,4,Cgrass fire in Weston-super-Mare
OL,6,FIn a post on social media, the owner
OL,7,Fconfirmed the "total loss" of the
OL,8,Fstudio. They added, "It appears the
OL,9,Fstudios have been involved in a
OL,10,Fmassive wildfire.
OL,12,F"Unfortunately, it looks like the
OL,13,Fstudios are a total loss and will be
OL,14,Fclosed until further notice.
OL,16,F"Thanks everyone for your support and
OL,17,Fonce we've had time to register
OL,18,Feverything we'll look at bookings
OL,19,Falready made and start refunding those
OL,20,Fbookings".
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G2/4
