CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F402A1787087916
OL,3,CSeveral businesses destroyed by large
OL,4,Cgrass fire in Weston-super-Mare
OL,6,FThe A371 remains closed from The
OL,7,FRunway to Banwell Road as crews
OL,8,Fcontinue to bring the grass fire near
OL,9,FLocking under control, with motorists
OL,10,Fasked to avoid the area and plan ahead
OL,11,Ffor their journeys.
OL,13,FDiversions are in place and the
OL,14,Fservice is asking people to minimise
OL,15,Ftravel in the area where possible and
OL,16,Fplan ahead.
OL,18,FFirefighters will remain on scene to
OL,19,Fidentify and deal with hotspots and
OL,20,Fcontinue damping down.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G3/4
