OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F402A1787087916
OL,3,CSeveral businesses destroyed by large
OL,4,Cgrass fire in Weston-super-Mare
OL,6,FLocal residents have been advised to
OL,7,Fcontinue to keep windows and doors
OL,8,Fclosed to prevent smoke from entering
OL,9,Fhomes or businesses.
OL,11,FThey are asking people to avoid the
OL,12,Farea to allow emergency services to
OL,13,Frespond safely.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G4/4
